url: https://jairaj1234-dancer.github.io/nighantu/
abstract: >-
  A referenced encyclopedia of Ayurvedic materia medica: single-herb monographs,
  classical formulations and Ayurvedic instruments, each opening with a
  definitional summary, stating identification and pharmacology as structured
  facts, citing the classical texts it draws on, and reporting published research
  with dates. Includes a practice guide to Shirodhara. Content incorporates
  material from the Amidha Ayurveda Herb Database under CC BY 4.0; see
  PROVENANCE.md for what is derived and what is original.
keywords:
  - ayurveda
  - materia medica
  - medicinal plants
  - dravyaguna
  - ethnobotany
  - shirodhara
  - panchakarma
  - traditional medicine
